def grade(score):
    if not 0 <= score <= 100:
        return "invalid"
    elif score >= 90:
        return "excellent"
    elif score >= 60:
        return "pass"
    else:
        return "retry"

print(grade(95))   # excellent
print(grade(72))   # pass
print(grade(41))   # retry
print(grade(120))  # invalid
```

The range check must come first because later branches assume the score is valid.

